1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:05,240
Drums go dead and silence falls.

2
00:00:05,459 --> 00:00:09,490
Cheers erupt across the walls.

3
00:00:09,779 --> 00:00:13,630
Chest is heaving, breath runs hot.

4
00:00:13,849 --> 00:00:18,170
Standing right upon the spot.

5
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:22,850
On the table by the wood,

6
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:27,070
Cardboard where the glasses stood.

7
00:00:27,289 --> 00:00:31,440
I Grab a coaster from the stack,

8
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:35,710
Time to pay an old debt back.

9
00:00:36,039 --> 00:00:40,079
Take a step and make a bow,

10
00:00:40,299 --> 00:00:44,439
Flat palm holds the token now.

11
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:48,890
Eyes lock on the paper ring,

12
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:53,299
Remembering the former sting.

13
00:00:53,409 --> 00:00:57,679
Once you threw it at my feet,

14
00:00:57,899 --> 00:01:01,869
Told me men don't face defeat.

15
00:01:02,090 --> 00:01:06,280
Now the circle turns around,

16
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:10,379
Look who rules the battleground.

17
00:01:30,599 --> 00:01:34,379
Shaking lips and sudden fire,

18
00:01:34,879 --> 00:01:38,680
Pride mixed with a wild desire.

19
00:01:39,230 --> 00:01:42,879
Taps the cardboard to my chest,

20
00:01:43,599 --> 00:01:47,269
Tucks it in her trouser west.

21
00:01:47,950 --> 00:01:51,980
"Cheeky beast," she whispers low,

22
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:56,319
"Look how far a lion can grow.

23
00:01:56,599 --> 00:02:00,980
You have led with all your might,

24
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:05,120
We own everything tonight."